Wayland clipboard reads keep every form an offer holds: its text (with its HTML), its picture (PNG, JPEG, GIF,
WebP, ...) and the local files a text/uri-list names, as one item's entries, so a paste can choose among them
(a screenshot, a browser's copied image beside its HTML, a file manager's copied files beside their paths).

